  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for another minute.",
    "Add the chopped celery and cook until it is tender.",
    "Add the fermented kimchi and cook for another 2 minutes.",
    "Stir in the chopped almonds and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
